        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/the-sinking-city-2-header-2_iRhyUfg.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>There's a bit, early on in <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/the-sinking-city-2\">The Sinking City 2</a>, where you enter the waterlogged Miskatonic University. As you teeter around toppled shelves and slalom through sodden tomes, a siren begins to blare. It's the last call for survivors hoping to flee the doomed city of Arkham, after which only a few determined souls remain. It feels like a world in the process of transition as we join it, and that's reflective of the series too.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/the-sinking-city-2-now-playing\">Read more</a></p>",
